The colour math, palette catalogue, gradient fields, effects, ANSI utilities,
layout analysis, settings defaults and look bundles originate in Pi Rainbow.
This port adds the OpenCode V2 lifecycle, native framebuffer adapter, menus,
commands, storage, animation scheduling and host-specific regression tests.

Pi Rainbow in turn credits oc-plugin-rainbow as its inspiration.
